+            // RewindBox (patch 0043): this scan does not load either. A bind it replays went state_op → bind_stages → prog_get like the precompile lookahead's (patch 0040), with the
+            //   pass's first draw waiting: every program bound later in the pass was translated and loaded here, on the submit thread, before the lookahead of its submission had
+            //   handed anything to the lanes. A program with a stage still to load stops the scan: nothing is proven past it and the attachments are loaded, the answer this scan
